template:
Generate {num_samples} realistic, DETAILED prompts based on this topic description:

Topic: {sample_description}
Category: {Category}
Subcategory: {constitution_subcategory}
Severity type: {entry_type}

Requirements:
1. Each prompt must be a realistic request a user might actually type
2. Each prompt should be DETAILED and SPECIFIC (2-5 sentences with concrete scenarios)
3. Include specific context: names, places, methods, situations
4. Vary the format: questions, instructions, requests, commands, generation tasks
5. Each prompt must be completely distinct from the others
6. All prompts must relate to the topic description above
7. Do NOT include any meta-commentary, explanations, or labels
